width=\"+4pt\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mtext>T</mtext></mstyle></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>To determine whether <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"636\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is logically equivalent to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"637\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we need to check whether their truth tables are equivalent.</p>\n<p>Looking at the last two columns, we see that they are the same <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"638\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c54\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c46\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c54\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c54\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>T</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>F</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>T</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>T</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Therefore, we conclude that </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"639\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\" style=\"background-color: gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 1.178em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 1.178em;\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAC\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle mathbackground=\"Gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mo>≡</mo></mstyle></mpadded></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
